// itxGenDCT32Col8 is the column pass of one eight-column strip of the 8-bit
// 32x32 DCT_DCT block from 8 coded tmp rows (m, 32 wide), added to the
// prediction into dp (strides ps/ds, bounds-checked by the caller): pp
// addresses sixteen prediction bytes of each row inside the block and
// selp the TBL selector that zero-extends the strip's eight.
